' Relations: DGGS Kinematics and Structural Decompositions
H3AdjacencyCoordinator ..> ApertureAnalysisResult : produces
H3AdjacencyCoordinator ..> Vector3D : resolves offset
h3_cell_registry "1" *-- "0..15" h3_aperture_tier_decompositions : contains tiers
h3_cell_registry "1" *-- "0..*" thermodynamic_patch_stocks : tracks historical states

' Relations: Thermodynamic Stocks, Monads and Routes
SpatialMonad *-- ThermodynamicStock : wraps immutable state
SpatialFluxMonad --> H3AdjacencyCoordinator : queries hasNonZeroApertureDigits()
SpatialFluxMonad ..> Vector3D : calculates drift
spatial_flux_coarsening_routes "0..*" --> "1" h3_cell_registry : source cell
spatial_flux_coarsening_routes "0..*" --> "1" h3_cell_registry : target parent cell

' Relations: Blockchain Ledger and Thermodynamic Transactions
thermodynamic_blocks "1" *-- "0..*" thermodynamic_stock_transactions : anchors transactions
thermodynamic_stock_transactions --> h3_cell_registry : source cell
thermodynamic_stock_transactions --> h3_cell_registry : destination cell
thermodynamic_stock_transactions --> spatial_flux_coarsening_routes : guided by route

